00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:12,161
For any particular term, write T r plus one, collect every power of x into a single exponent, and set it equal to the power you want.

3
00:00:12,161 --> 00:00:16,184
If r does not come out a whole number, the term simply does not exist.

